# Agent contract (Cursor adapter)

Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for safety, environments, autonomy, escalation, and PR handoff.

Use [`.agents/skills/`](../../.agents/skills/) for procedures. Do not copy or override those rules here.

Start new work in a git worktree ([`.agents/skills/git-worktree/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/git-worktree/SKILL.md)). After creating or selecting it, move the agent root there before the first edit. Remove the worktree after that PR is merged.

Conventional commits remain in [`conventional-commits.mdc`](conventional-commits.mdc).
